loading_tips = PackedStringArray("Armored Knights block body shots from the front: aim over the shield, or flank them.", "A knight that raps its sword on its shield is about to charge: step out of its line, then shoot while its guard is wide.", "Jesters juggle before they throw a pin. A headshot spills the throw.", "The south wall-walk is high ground with a view over the moat: two stairs climb to it from the courtyard.", "The stands beside the jousting list are high ground too, with stairs at both ends.", "When the siege engines fire, a gold ring marks every boulder: step out of it.", "The Black Knight charges down a lane and is dazed after it: punish the glow.")
